    1: """
       
       Rules for building C/API module with f2py2e.
       
       Here is a skeleton of a new wrapper function (13Dec2001):
       
       wrapper_function(args)
         declarations
         get_python_arguments, say, `a' and `b'
       
         get_a_from_python
         if (successful) {
       
           get_b_from_python
           if (successful) {
       
             callfortran
             if (successful) {
       
               put_a_to_python
               if (successful) {
       
                 put_b_to_python
                 if (successful) {
       
                   buildvalue = ...
       
                 }
       
               }
       
             }
       
           }
           cleanup_b
       
         }
         cleanup_a
       
         return buildvalue
       
